WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:26.125
- OK, Kawhi, it’s the conference semifinals.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:26.333
- OK, Kawhi, it’s the conference semifinals.

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:29.625
You can try to roll a 20 to hit an off-balance buzzer-beater over Embiid...

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.625
- No way! That’s impossible!

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:35.000
Roll a one to 15, and we can regroup in overtime.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.708
- Don’t listen to Gasol. Take the play off for load management!

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.583
- Guys, I got this.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.375
It's all part of the game.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:50.916
- Yes!

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:51.916
- Victory!

00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:52.625
- We won!

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.666
Embiid's crying, and we won!

00:00:54.666 --> 00:00:55.958
- Hey, guys.

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:56.666
Can I play?

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:57.750
- No, Pau.

00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:00.125
He refuses to retire.

00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:03.541
- Charge! Charge!

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:04.666
Foul on you!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.208
- Hey, Drake...

00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:08.208
is Kawhi home?

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.208
- No.

00:01:09.208 --> 00:01:11.083
My boy never came home last night,

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:14.708
and I think he's trying to send me a message through the Canada Day lights.

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.750
What is he trying to tell us?

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.041
I can't crack the code.

00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:21.500
- Don't worry, Drake.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.416
We'll find him.

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:25.958
- You should check the Sports Science Lab on the outskirts of town.

00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:30.083
I'd go myself, but I was banned for giving Nick Nurse a shoulder rub.

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:31.583
- How are we going to get in?

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:32.375
- Easy.

00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:34.416
The lab is defended by the Washington Wizards.

00:01:34.416 --> 00:01:35.750
If you get past Bradley Beal,

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.750
there's zero help.

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:38.541
- Three-on-one! Three-on-one!

00:01:38.541 --> 00:01:39.208
Little help?

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:40.208
- Hey.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.125
Wait.

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:41.875
Stop.

00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:47.708
- Thank God everything in this town is a short bike ride apart.

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:50.291
Now let's fan out and find Kawhi!

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:51.750
- You won't find him here.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:52.750
It's too late!

00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.541
- Doctor Rivers?!

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:58.541
- I bleed Raptors red.

00:01:58.791 --> 00:01:59.875
- Thanks, VanVleet.

00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:01.791
- You can call me Twenty-three.

00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:03.166
Kawhi went through that portal.

00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:06.083
- The Upside Down!

00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:09.666
- Well, technically, the Jay Bilas Tremendous Upside Down.

00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:12.375
- Dios mío!

00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:14.666
The Upside Down is even worse than I imagined.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.208
- I think this is just downtown Los Angeles.

00:02:17.666 --> 00:02:18.791
- There's Kawhi!

00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:20.083
- And Danny Green!

00:02:20.083 --> 00:02:21.708
- We don’t care about him!

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:23.125
Kawhi!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.958
- The Demo-George-an!

00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:31.250
- But seriously, Kawhi can’t go back.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.333
I blew up my old team to play with him.

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:34.333
- He's right.

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.500
Sorry, guys, I’m staying here.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.750
- What? We won a campaign together!

00:02:39.083 --> 00:02:41.500
Don’t you realize how rare that is in Toronto?

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.375
And what’s so special about this guy?

00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:46.583
Well, when healthy, he’s an excellent two-way Demo-George-an.

00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:48.791
- But Kawhi, we had a historic run.

00:02:48.791 --> 00:02:50.000
C’mon...

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.833
don’t you want to defend our title?

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.125
- No.

00:02:53.125 --> 00:02:55.166
It’s 70 degrees and sunny here,

00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:56.625
I’m tired of children's games, 

00:02:56.625 --> 00:02:58.083
and most of all...

00:02:58.083 --> 00:03:00.625
I just don't want to play with you guys anymore.

00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:01.500
- Fine.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.291
We don't need you anyway!

00:03:03.291 --> 00:03:05.875
We’re still a respectable two seed.

00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:11.791
All right, Pascal, it’s Game 7 of the conference semifinals.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:14.833
You need to roll a 15 or a 10 to send it into overtime.

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:20.375
- Outcome unclear.

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:23.500
But Pascal kicked Daniel Theis in the face!

00:03:34.666 --> 00:03:37.416
- No, I am the real Chris Paul.

00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:38.875
You want the real deal,

00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:41.083
especially when it comes to home and auto insurance.

